| `tests/integration/test_external_waiver_gate.py` | Derives external lint codes from `pyproject.toml` and Python roots from Makefile `PY_ROOTS`, then fails a named waiver without a same-code Ruff diagnostic on its line. | `make test` | — | Unknown codes require a named custom gate; zero Ruff codes or zero waivers fails. Not for reflection policy or waiver reasons: `tests/integration/test_banned_api_gate.py` judges those for TID251. | [coding-practices.md](../guides/coding-practices.md) | always |
